nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格降至4.9元/千次</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Neuralink脑机接口接入Grok大模型，患者实现意念唤醒AI与语音通话</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral正式开源万亿参数模型Le Chonk：Mistral Large4以高Token效率对标顶级性能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini升级：支持PDF、表格及代码文件在聊天窗口内联编辑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌Gemini人工智能助手迎来重大功能升级，正式支持在聊天界面内直接对生成的文件进行预览与修改，实现了“生成-修改”的闭环操作。此次更新涵盖PDF、谷歌文档、谷歌表格、演示文稿、Markdown、TXT及各类代码文件。其中，PDF预览与编辑功能已同步覆盖网页端与移动端，其余格式目前主要支持网页端。用户现可全屏打开文档进行精细编辑，或通过选中特定文本直接向Gemini下达修改指令，例如将表格一键转换为图表。该功能将编辑能力直接内嵌至Gemini独立聊天界面，无需跳转至外部应用或依赖Workspace侧边栏，显著提升了办公与内容创作的交互效率。随着主流AI助手相继补齐内联编辑短板，对话式AI作为生产力工具的边界正进一步拓宽。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，支持8人同时识别</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，该模型采用MoE架构，总参数量340亿，每次前向传播激活43亿参数，在保证推理性能的同时优化了运行效率。在核心能力上，该模型支持单次处理长达1小时的音频，涵盖40种语言转录及31种语言与英语的双向互译。针对多人对话场景，模型可同时区分并识别多达8名说话人。在基准测试中，Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe表现优异，Open ASR英语组词错误率（WER）仅为5.33%，在Artificial Analysis非流式测试中WER进一步降至2.8%，并列开源榜首。该模型的发布为开发者提供了处理复杂长音频、跨国会议纪要及多人访谈场景的高性能基座，显著提升了多说话人分离与多语种处理的行业技术标准。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格降至4.9元/千次</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/832677c3abf303c4a95b4b9406abe79c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式宣布升级百度AI搜索与搜索AI API，旨在降低开发者接入成本并拓展应用场景。此次升级中，搜索AI API推出活动优惠，调用价格低至4.9元/千次。百度App同步完成四大功能迭代：文心助手实现从“一次问答”向“一份交付”的模式升级，覆盖170余种场景；AI镜头新增动态追踪功能并支持9种方言实时对话；GUI互动场景数据接入规模提升5倍，覆盖超50亿条数据；AI互动应用领域则上线了AI互动剧等内容。此次动作标志着百度AI搜索正从单一检索工具向任务交付、实时交互及内容消费的综合服务形态转型。通过大幅降低API调用门槛，百度意在加速AI搜索能力在企业级应用及第三方产品中的规模化落地，进一步构建开放的AI搜索生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Neuralink脑机接口接入Grok大模型，患者实现意念唤醒AI与语音通话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4346e49eb882ea8c7f9302488390c497.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Neuralink近日完成重大技术升级，成功将Grok大模型接入脑机接口系统，使患者能够通过意念直接唤醒并操控AI智能体。在为期72小时的闭关开发中，团队为P21临床试验患者Kenneth实现了8项核心功能。关键技术包括：Neural VAD（神经语音活动检测）系统，实现零按键、纯意念的自动语音解码；实时神经信号可视化，辅助患者通过闭环反馈训练解码器；以及系统级脑机输入法，支持在iOS锁屏状态下秒级发音。最显著的突破在于Grok的深度集成，患者默念指令即可唤醒Grok接管屏幕执行复杂操作，并能将解码语音接入iPhone麦克风实现意念通话。此次升级解决了脑机接口带宽限制的瓶颈，通过AI托管繁琐的界面操作，将单一意念转化为复杂行为，标志着人机协同技术迈向新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral正式开源万亿参数模型Le Chonk：Mistral Large4以高Token效率对标顶级性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">欧洲AI企业Mistral正式开源代号为“Le Chonk”的旗舰模型Mistral Large4。该模型拥有1万亿参数，在欧洲本土基础设施上从零训练。性能方面，其在FrontierCode2.0测试中获19.7%高分，并在Coding Agent Index评测中与GLM-5.3持平。核心优势在于极高的Token效率，同等性能下编程任务Token消耗较竞品减少47%。Mistral通过三周强化学习训练提供三种推理模式，以平衡性能与成本。安全层面，模型在Cyber Index得分51%，越狱请求平均拒绝率达96.6%。Mistral已向Orange Cyberdefense等伙伴开放特定变体预览。该模型采用修改版MIT协议，允许免费使用、修改及商业化，但MaaS类企业商用需申请商业许可。目前用户可通过Huggi</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
